# into this file.
# Added here: Daily Delivery (469: Einar Stonegrip by Howin to James Halloran); Velinde Starsong, Velinde's Effects and The Barrens Port (1037-1039: Melyria at the end of the Ashenvale trip, then a Rut'theran hop from Auberdine to Thyn'tel Bladeweaver in Darnassus before the boat; 1039 goes to Ratchet in 30-40); Crimson Crate Delivery (98240), which James Halloran offers only after Crocs of the Sky (98072) is handed in on this guide's last Menethil stop, for Howin Kindfeather on 30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills' Wetlands loop.
# Hand-ins for quests carried from an older route (0.3.4's Darkshore before the 0.3.5 re-order, or a
# guide left early): Therylune's Escape (945), Trek to Ashenvale (990), The Tower of Althalaxx (967) and
# Expanding Horizons (97914) on the stops this guide already makes at their enders, each only while
# carried (`when onquest`), as Thundris Windweaver's below.
# Also left out: This Land Was Their Land (98230), which Captain Stoutfist offers only after Defeat Nek'rosh (474) is handed in (#1299): it is on the group branch of 30-40/01-hillsbrad-foothills.
# Bloom of the Heavens (98208, 98209: 1750 + 1200 XP) from Sylessa Duskwhisper by Menethil's docks: Nord'el lies on the
# shore just south of the town, and the follow-up goes to Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine on this guide's boat trip.
# Vengeful Trail (98417, 1700 XP) from Maseara Autumnmoon at Forest Song: Kurothel's Knapsack lies by Satyrnaar's Circle of
# Imprisonment, visited between Fallen Sky Lake and Kayneth's hand-in. Left out: its follow-up Shared Fury (98418), twenty
# Xavian satyrs back west (five Betrayers, who have two spawns) and a second walk back to Forest Song.
# Insane Druids (1012, level 32) is optional: three druids deep in the Dor'Danil Barrow Den, a
# respawning cave of stealthed mobs, with Kayneth Stillwind before and after (a back-and-forth across
# south-east Ashenvale for one quest). Players' recordings: nobody took it on a recorded version.
# Fix round 2026-11-20: the Wetlands are finished on this visit at about 29-30. After Rethiel's Blisters on the Land the
# east loop goes on to the Dragonmaw Gates (Crocs of the Sky 98072, Howin's Razormaw Needling and Trying Times 98245,
# 98246) and north to Dun Modr and the Thandol Span (Fall of Dun Modr 472, The Thandol Span 631-633, Plea to the
# Alliance 634 for Refuge Pointe, Sully Balloo's Letter 637 for Ironforge), then back past Howin to Menethil; Lifting
# the Curse (290, 292, 293: Captain Halyndor is 30) is taken with The Cursed Crew's hand-in and worked from level 29
# at the end of the visit, and Lightforge Iron (321, 324, 322) is on the first Menethil stops for a player carrying
# The Doomed Fleet (270) from Bishop Farthing (05-duskwood, after Proving Your Worth from 28). They were on a third
# Wetlands visit at 30.8-32 (30-40/01, 30-40/03), which keeps them for a character who arrives without them.
# Blisters on the Land's Fen Creepers are hunted along the river west of Einar (data/places.json
# 610-wetlands-fen-creepers), not across the zone.
# Raene Wolfrunner's An Aggressive Defense and Culling the Threat (1025, 1054), Elemental Bracers (1016) and the
# Gleaming Crescent Necklace (98027) are done at the end of 06-ashenvale's first visit, at about 24-25 (fix round
# 2026-11-20); the steps here are only for a character who arrives without them (`when !turnedin`).
# Hand-cut 2026-11-07 (the Alliance 21-24 level hole) from the old 25-29 06-ashenvale and the
# Wetlands visit of 07-thousand-needles: the Wetlands are one visit at 27-29, after Duskwood.
# Since 2026-11-07 Ashenvale's 27-32 quests follow on the same trip (the order their quest
# levels fit: Wetlands 27-29, then Ashenvale 28-30), by boat from Menethil to
# Auberdine; they were in 30-40/03, at 33-34. Then back by boat to Menethil, Pilot Longbeard in
# Ironforge (28) and The Missing Diplomat in Stormwind (28), on to the Duskwood return.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Night Elf and Skyborne Druids: Moonglade and Darnassus

step Moonglade
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid
