  only NightElf,Skyborne,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  when turnedin 272
  when !turnedin 5061
  tip Take Aquatic Form from Dendrite Starblaze, upstairs in his building. Then Silva Fil'naveth in Nighthaven flies Druids straight to Rut'theran Village.
  accept 5061                                 -- Dendrite Starblaze
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

