# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Dragonmaw Gates and Dun Modr

step Dragonmaw Gates: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip East from Rethiel: the Crimson Whelps (25-26) nest in the hills north-east of the Angerfang Encampment, and the Highland Razormaws (27-28) hunt the highlands north of them, towards Dun Modr. The Perfect Razormaw Eggs lie in the raptors' nests.
  tip Careful: Carnage, an elite raptor, prowls the hills north of the whelps, and Ados, an elite Goaz guardian, stands at the Dragonmaw Gates: give both room. The Dragonmaw east of Howin are elite too.
  collect 279385 quest 98072.1            -- Pristine Crimson Scale
  collect 280103 quest 98245.1            -- Razormaw Incisor
  collect 280132 quest 98246.1 @69.2,32.7 -- Perfect Razormaw Egg

step Longbraid the Grim
  when onquest 472
  tip North-west to the road and north along it to Dun Modr. Longbraid the Grim and Rhag Garmason stand together in the dwarves' camp on the east side of the road; the Dark Iron ruins west of it are full of elites: keep to the road.
  tip Careful: Modr (32, elite) walks the Dark Iron ruins about 55 yards west of Rhag; players have met it from the camp and the road: stay on the camp's east side.
  turnin 472                              -- Longbraid the Grim

step Dun Modr
  tip Rhag Garmason stands beside Longbraid in the dwarves' camp at Dun Modr, east of the road; keep out of the Dark Iron ruins west of it, where Modr (32, elite) walks.
  accept 631                              -- Rhag Garmason

step Ebenezer Rustlocke
  zone Wetlands
  tip North along the road from Dun Modr towards the Thandol Span: Ebenezer Rustlocke's corpse lies under the span. His parchment goes back to Rhag.
  tip Careful: Two elite Dark Iron Saboteurs (28-29) stand by the corpse inside the span: loot the corpse and walk straight out without fighting, or, from level 31, pull them one at a time.
  turnin 631                              -- Ebenezer Rustlocke's Corpse, inside
  accept 632                              -- the same corpse

step Rhag Garmason
  zone Wetlands
  tip Back down the road to Dun Modr: Rhag wants the Dark Iron explosives under the far end of the span destroyed. Keep to the camp's east side, away from Modr (32, elite) in the ruins.
  turnin 632                              -- Rhag Garmason
  accept 633

step The Cache of Explosives
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Over the Thandol Span: the Dark Irons' cache of explosives sits by its Arathi end.
  tip Careful: Dark Iron Shadowcasters (31-32) and Bombardiers (30-31), who fight from range, and a Supplier (31-32) stand within 15-25 yards of the cache: pull them one at a time to the bridge before you touch it.
  interact 2704 quest 633.1               -- Cache of Explosives

step Waterlogged Envelope
  tip In the river under the Arathi end of the span, a Waterlogged Envelope lies on the bottom: Sara Balloo in Ironforge, at the end of this guide, takes it.
  collect 4433 x1 optional @44.3,92.9 map 1417 -- Underwater
  accept 637 optional

step Rhag Garmason again
