  tip Back over the span and down the road to Dun Modr, on the camp's east side, away from Modr (32, elite) in the ruins.
  turnin 633                              -- Rhag Garmason
  accept 634                              -- For Captain Nials at Refuge Pointe, on your Arathi Highlands visit (30-40)

