# Fresh-start pace (0.4.0, first made for 0.3.7): a character loading this guide without 06-ashenvale's Wetlands and
# Ashenvale quests left it a level lower than the route player in the original check. Every
# route player is past 28 here, so only that character tops up, by Menethil, before Ashenvale's 28-32 quests.
step Level 28
  when level<28
  tip Still below level 28? That happens when you start this guide here without the Wetlands and Ashenvale quests of the guides before it: top up on the Bluegill Raiders along the coast just south of Menethil before the boat, so Ashenvale's level 28-32 quests aren't too hard.
  goto 8.6,69.0 map 1437 "Bluegill Raider"
  level 28 grind 1418                  -- grind on Bluegill Raider

