  tip Forest Song, the Night Elf outpost at the eastern end of the road: Kayneth Stillwind stands there, Maseara Autumnmoon a few steps east of her.
  turnin 4581                         -- Kayneth Stillwind
  accept 1011
  accept 98417                        -- Maseara Autumnmoon: her husband's trail in Satyrnaar, on the way back from the lake

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south-east

step The Dor'Danil Barrow Den: kill these as you meet them
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The Forsaken's camp lies in the woods south of Forest Song.
  tip Rotting Slimes in and around the Barrow Den leave a Rusty Chest when they die: open the chests until one holds the pommel.
  tip Careful: Non-elite Forsaken of about level 28-30 guard the camp. Some of them are stealthed, and the ones around the table often aggro together.
  collect 5519 quest 1027             -- Iron Pommel
  collect 5440 quest 1011             -- Bottle of Disease

step Fallen Sky Lake
  tip The Shadethicket Oracle walks the shore of Fallen Sky Lake, south-west of the chests; the Gleaming Crescent Pendant lies north of the lake, on the way.
  tip Careful: Other mobs, some of them underwater, sit near the island. Clear them first so they don't join the fight when you pull the Oracle.
  collect 5508 quest 1035             -- Fallen Moonstone
  accept 98027 object 669176          -- Gleaming Crescent Pendant: for Maliynn in Astranaar

step Satyrnaar
  tip North from the lake to the satyr camp of Satyrnaar, just west of Forest Song: the Circle of Imprisonment stands in it, and Kurothel's Knapsack lies beside it with the Vine-Wrapped Scroll.
  tip Careful: The Felmusk Rogues in Night Run often go stealthed, and Satyrnaar has satyr casters.
  interact 20352 quest 1140.2         -- Circle of Imprisonment
  collect 281014 quest 98417 @81.7,49.2 -- Vine-Wrapped Scroll, from Kurothel's Knapsack

step Kayneth Stillwind
  turnin 1011
  tip Optional: Kayneth also offers Insane Druids, three level 32 druids deep in The Dor'Danil Barrow Den, a cave of quickly respawning, stealthed mobs, and back to her afterwards. It is above your level here: take it only if you are grouped or want the extra XP; the guide doesn't need it.
  accept 1012 optional
  turnin 98417                        -- Maseara Autumnmoon, a few steps east

# Players' recordings: the barrow's mouth near 75.95,75.45, south of the Forsaken camp; the
# walking maps lead over the hill above the druids instead (#1336).
step The Dor'Danil Barrow Den's entrance
  when group 1012
  when onquest 1012
  goto 75.95,75.45 live "The Dor'Danil Barrow Den"

step Insane druids
  when group 1012
  when onquest 1012
  tip The three druids are inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den, apart from each other: go in at its mouth, south of the Forsaken camp, not over the hill above them. Taneel Darkwood is in the eastern halls, Uthil Mooncall deepest down at the north-east end and Mavoris Cloudsbreak at the western end.
  tip Careful: The den has many mobs that respawn quickly, including stealthed undead and patrols, so extra mobs often join a fight.
  kill 3940 quest 1012.1              -- Taneel Darkwood, inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den
  kill 3941 quest 1012.2              -- Uthil Mooncall, inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den
  kill 3942 quest 1012.3              -- Mavoris Cloudsbreak, inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den

step Forest Song
  when group 1012
  when onquest 1012
  turnin 1012                         -- Kayneth Stillwind

