step The Howling Vale
  tip Take the tunnel into the Howling Vale; the tome lies in the ruins at its west end. Careful: Terrowulf Fleshrippers and Shadow Weavers (28-30) stand in tight packs around the tome, and the Terrowulf Packlord, a level 32 rare, walks the vale. Pull the wolves one at a time from the tunnel and let the Packlord pass first.
  interact 19027 quest 1022.1         -- Tome of Mel'Thandris

step Astranaar
  tip Raene Wolfrunner and Maliynn are in the inn; Pelturas Whitemoon is inside the building just south of it.
  turnin 1029                         -- Raene Wolfrunner
  accept 1030
  turnin 98027                        -- Maliynn, in the inn
  turnin 1035                         -- Pelturas Whitemoon, inside the building south of the inn

step Raene Wolfrunner
  when !turnedin 1025
  tip Not done on your first Ashenvale visit? Raene also has An Aggressive Defense (the Foulweald, on the way to Krolg) and Culling the Threat (Dal Bloodclaw, on the way back from Maestra's Post).
  accept 1025                         -- Raene Wolfrunner: An Aggressive Defense
  accept 1054                         -- Raene Wolfrunner: Culling the Threat

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Krolg

step The Foulweald
  when !turnedin 1025
  tip On the way south-east to Krolg: the Foulweald furbolgs live in the woods south of the road, south-east of Astranaar. The Den Watcher and the Ursas guard the den.
  kill 3746 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Den Watcher
  kill 3749 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Ursa
  kill 3750 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Totemic
  kill 3743 quest 1025                    -- Foulweald Warrior

step Mystral Lake
  when !turnedin 1016
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Sentinel Velene Starstrike stands at the Silverwind Refuge on the east shore of Mystral Lake, just north of the road to Krolg. Befouled Water Elementals wade in the lake; Tideress, a level 27 water elemental, walks among them and drops the bracers too.
  accept 1016                             -- Sentinel Velene Starstrike
  collect 12220 x5 optional           -- Underwater
  collect 5455 quest 1016 @49.6,71.3      -- Kill the elementals for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, then use the Divining Scroll
  turnin 1016

step Krolg
  tip Krolg, a furbolg untouched by the corruption, sits south of the road below Mystral Lake. Use Dartol's Rod of Transformation near him first: he only speaks to you in furbolg form.
  turnin 1030
  accept 1045

step Ran Bloodtooth
  tip Ran Bloodtooth and his guards camp just east of Krolg.
  tip Careful: Wolves and spiders roam near the camp and can join a fight. Some of the wolves come in pairs.
  kill 3932 quest 1045.1              -- Bloodtooth Guard
  collect 5388 quest 1045.2           -- Ran Bloodtooth's Skull, from Ran Bloodtooth

step Krolg
  turnin 1045
  accept 1046
  complete 1046

